    "cons": [
      "Mild eggy taste in plain water",
      "No sport certification we could confirm; sodium is notable (about 380 mg per serving in one database)"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The cleanest everyday egg white powder: high protein per calorie with nothing added that you would not want.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein / serving": "About 25 g",
      "Calories": "About 110",
      "Third-party tested": "Check certifier databases",
      "Best for": "Smoothies, oats and everyday use"
    }
