    "name": "NOW Sports Egg White Protein (Unflavored)",
    "brand": "NOW Foods",
    "badge": "Best Certified",
    "category": "Egg white protein (unflavored)",
    "description": "NOW Sports Egg White Protein lists about 15 to 16 g of protein per quarter-cup (20 g) scoop for roughly 70 to 80 calories, per the label at the time of writing; listings differ slightly by batch. The smaller scoop means you will want about one and a half scoops to reach 25 g of protein. NOW lists the Informed Choice and Informed Sport marks, which is rare among egg proteins, and the powder is pasteurized.",
    "pros": [
      "Listed with Informed Choice and Informed Sport marks",
      "Short ingredient list: egg white powder and sunflower lecithin",
      "Widely available from a long-established brand"
    ],
