      "No third-party certification we could find"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "A reasonable pick if you like the idea of a whole-egg powder; plain egg white is leaner and simpler.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein / serving": "About 24 g",
      "Calories": "About 110 (flavor-dependent)",
      "Third-party tested": "None found",
      "Best for": "Whole-egg fans"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "judees-dried-egg-white-protein",
    "name": "Judee's Dried Egg White Protein Powder",
    "brand": "Judee's Gluten Free",
    "badge": "Best for Baking",
    "category": "Pasteurized dried egg whites (single ingredient)",
