              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is egg white protein powder dairy-free?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Pure egg white protein is dairy-free, which is why it is popular with people who have a milk allergy or avoid dairy. Check the label, though: some egg products are blends that also contain whey or casein, and several are made in facilities that handle milk. People with a severe milk allergy should look for a clear allergen statement.
