              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">How much protein is in egg white protein powder?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Most shake-style egg white powders list about 24 to 25 g of protein per serving for roughly 110 to 120 calories, per their labels at the time of writing. NOW Sports uses a smaller 20 g scoop with about 15 to 16 g of protein. Pure dried egg whites provide roughly 4 g of protein per tablespoon.
              </p>
